f their god requires. But amongst Christians, for no repute amongst men, for no stipend, for no mere show, they practise an absolute virginity; and as they `liked to retain God in their knowledge, 0' so God has kept them in that liking mind, and in the performance of fitting works, filling them with righteousness and goodness. I say this without any depreciation of what is beautiful in Greek thought, and of what is wholesome in their teachings. I wish only to show that all they have said, and things more noble, more divine, have been said by those men of God, the prophets and apostles.\""},{"id":"3137e580a6c7","b":"PSA","v":"npnf.gregor_nyssa.de_virginitate","w":"gregor_nyssa.de_virginitate","a":"gregor_v_nyssa","s":17,"p":[0,0],"r":[19,7],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"medium","cited":"Ps. xix. 6, Ps. xix. 7, Ps xix. 8.","note":"Stellenangabe der Ausgabe (englische Zählung, umgerechnet)"},{"id":"3ec2c3aec340","b":"PSA","v":"npnf.gregor_nyssa.de_virginitate","w":"gregor_nyssa.de_virginitate","a":"gregor_v_nyssa","s":17,"p":[0,0],"r":[19,8],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"medium","cited":"Ps. xix. 6, Ps. xix. 7, Ps xix. 8.","note":"Stellenangabe der Ausgabe (englische Zählung, umgerechnet)"},{"id":"d2b87706c956","b":"PSA","v":"npnf.gregor_nyssa.de_virginitate","w":"gregor_nyssa.de_virginitate","a":"gregor_v_nyssa","s":17,"p":[0,0],"r":[19,9],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"medium","cited":"Ps. xix. 6, Ps. xix. 7, Ps xix. 8.","note":"Stellenangabe der Ausgabe (englische Zählung, umgerechnet)"},{"id":"2c4faef62729","b":"MAT","v":"npnf.gregor_nyssa.de_virginitate","w":"gregor_nyssa.de_virginitate","a":"gregor_v_nyssa","s":17,"p":[0,0],"r":[10,16],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"S. Matt. x. 16."},{"id":"8b9023680925","b":"1CO","v":"npnf.gregor_nyssa.de_virginitate","w":"gregor_nyssa.de_virginitate","a":"gregor_v_nyssa","s":18,"p":[0,0],"r":[3,12],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"1 Cor. i